[node name="Body" parent="Civilian5" index="1"]
LINES = [ "Can't even take a piss without some freak like you bothering me.", "What is it? Be quick about it.", "This trip is an absolute disaster. All of our deals have gone to shit. I'm readying myself to declare bankruptcy.", "The other guys seem to be more interested in \"relaxing\". I'm the only serious business minded individual here.", "You're also one? That's good." ]

