[node name="Body" parent="Civilian3" index="1"]
LINES = [ "It's only me left in this household now...", "Every night they come and take someone. I don't know where or why.", "I used to live here with my wife and our bul... Housemate. We never had much but it was a simple and carefree life.", "I'm thinking about killing myself before they come for me. Sorry for being so direct. But you haven't seen them.", "I used to be a corporate bigshot but that life just wasn't for me. I bought this nice house and settled down.", "Things only started getting bad during the last couple of months. The soil turned foul, got a fleshy rotten smell to it. All of our crops died.", "Then those things started harassing us. Not just my family but everyone else living in the region.", "It gradually got worse and worse. And now everyone's gone.", "Please help me find my wife I'm so lonely." ]

