LINES = [ "Oh my god!! Are you here to get me? What have I done?", "I swear I'm just trying to make life better for everyone here.", "I couldn't handle working for Godhead Heavy Industries anymore, that place is soulsucking and has zero ethics.", "Veggo's Meatoids is my baby... I can finally do something to make the world a better place, with 100% vegan earthmeat.", "Well technically it's not vegan but I don't think the planet can actually feel.", "I hope it doesn't..." ]

